-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Exercise 15 - Identifying Locations with the Highest
Concentration of Premium Data Analyst Jobs

Business Problem:
The recruiting team received a limited marketing budget to promote 
premium Data Analyst positions. For this analysis,
premium jobs are defined as those offering an annual
salary of at least $120,000. The manager wants to identify
which locations have the highest concentration of these premium opportunities
in order to prioritize future recruiting investments.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

SELECT COUNT(job_location) AS Rank,
       job_location
FROM job_postings_fact
WHERE job_title_short = 'Data Analyst'
  AND salary_year_avg > 120000
GROUP BY job_location
ORDER BY Rank DESC;

-- Business Insight:
-- "Anywhere" has the highest concentration of premium Data Analyst job postings,
-- followed by New York. These two locations stand out compared to the others,
-- making them strong candidates for prioritizing future recruiting efforts.
